flowchart TD
    U[Pet owner] --> UI[Streamlit app.py]
    UI --> V[Input validation and guardrails]
    V -->|Invalid| ERR[Show correction message]
    V -->|Valid| DATA[Owner, Pet, Task records in pawpal_system.py]
    DATA --> PLAN[Planning agent: propose timed care plan]
    PLAN --> CHECK[Evaluator: check overlaps, budget and omissions]
    CHECK -->|Fixable issue| REVISE[Revise proposed slots]
    REVISE --> CHECK
    CHECK -->|Unresolved issue| FLAG[Flag tasks for manual review]
    CHECK -->|Pass| EXPLAIN[Explain choices and tradeoffs]
    FLAG --> EXPLAIN
    EXPLAIN --> UI
    UI --> APPROVE{Owner reviews plan}
    APPROVE -->|Accept| SAVE[Apply approved changes]
    APPROVE -->|Reject| UI
    TEST[Pytest and scenario evaluation] -.-> V
    TEST -.-> PLAN
    TEST -.-> CHECK
